%% Implemented PostgreSQL inbox path. Each colored phase owns a separate transaction.
%% The caller represents the platform for usage and an operator for monthly closing.
%% Rated groups are stored results<br/>Go worker functions perform the calculation.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Platform / operator
    participant A as Go billing API
    participant W as Go usage worker
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    Note over C,D: Row selector: customer_billing_state.customer_id = C<br/>Event row: usage_inbox.source = S and usage_inbox.event_id = E<br/>Catalog advisory (65102, 2): protects price_versions, not a column

    rect rgb(233, 247, 238)
        Note over C,D: A. Receive a batch<br/>financial accounting is asynchronous
        C->>A: POST /usage/batches with stable (source, event_id)
        A->>A: Validate the batch<br/>supply UTC received_at
        A->>D: BEGIN<br/>synchronous_commit = on
        A->>D: INSERT usage_inbox<br/>compare content on duplicate keys
        Note over A,D: Identical retry preserves the original usage_inbox row and processing state.<br/>Changed content rolls back the entire batch with 409.
        A->>D: COMMIT the complete usage_inbox row batch
        D-->>A: Durable usage_inbox rows
        A-->>C: 202 accepted
    end

    rect rgb(237, 240, 255)
        Note over W,D: B. Account one pending usage_inbox row<br/>One atomic transaction
        W->>D: SELECT pending usage_inbox candidate<br/>Outside the transaction
        D-->>W: usage_inbox row identity and customer
        W->>D: BEGIN<br/>lock FOR UPDATE<br/>customer_billing_state.customer_id = C
        W->>D: Shared catalog lock<br/>recheck FOR UPDATE<br/>usage_inbox.source = S<br/>usage_inbox.event_id = E
        Note over W,D: Recheck: another worker completed this usage_inbox row?<br/>Commit without financial writes.
        W->>D: SELECT price_versions
        D-->>W: Historical default and customer prices
        W->>W: Rate at consumption time<br/>Determine usage_month and exact charge
        W->>D: SELECT closed_billing_months
        D-->>W: Committed closure history
        W->>W: Choose billing_month<br/>Allocate exact available credit
        W->>D: SELECT rated_usage_groups<br/>Existing cumulative gross
        W->>W: Add the exact charge to cumulative gross<br/>Validate the supported invoice-cent range
        W->>D: UPSERT rated_usage_groups<br/>INSERT usage_ratings link
        W->>D: INSERT credit_entries debit<br/>Only when credit is used
        W->>D: UPSERT monthly_usage<br/>Original usage_month
        W->>D: UPDATE customer_billing_state<br/>Credit and state_version
        W->>D: UPDATE usage_inbox.processed_at
        W->>D: COMMIT all accounting effects together
        Note over W,D: Domain error: commit processing_error<br/>Without financial effects.<br/>Database error: roll back and retry.
    end

    rect rgb(255, 244, 223)
        Note over C,D: C. Explicit monthly close<br/>independent of the worker loop
        C->>A: POST /customers/{customer_id}/invoices with month
        A->>D: BEGIN<br/>lock the same FOR UPDATE<br/>customer_billing_state.customer_id = C
        A->>D: SELECT invoices for customer and month
        alt Invoice already exists
            D-->>A: Original immutable snapshot
            A->>D: COMMIT without publication writes
        else First publication for this customer and month
            A->>D: Validate ended UTC month and chronological closing history
            A->>D: SELECT customers and next_invoice_number
            A->>D: SELECT rated_usage_groups for billing_month
            A->>D: SELECT addon_subscriptions and addon_cancellations
            D-->>A: Buyer details, processed group totals and active add-ons
            A->>A: Round group gross and net<br/>assemble lines and total cents
            Note over A,D: Credit was allocated by the worker<br/>do not debit it again.<br/>Pending and quarantined target-month usage_inbox rows are not processed here.
            A->>D: INSERT closed_billing_months
            A->>D: INSERT invoices with snapshot.lines
            A->>D: INSERT invoiced_usage_groups to freeze included groups
            A->>D: UPDATE customer_billing_state number and state_version
            A->>D: COMMIT closure, snapshot, frozen links and counters together
            D-->>A: Durable immutable invoice
        end
        A-->>C: 200 with invoice snapshot and number
        Note over W,D: Worker reads closure under the account lock.<br/>Closed or skipped original month?<br/>Route to an eligible later billing_month.<br/>Keep usage_month and historical price.<br/>Issued invoices remain unchanged.
    end
